{
  "$description": "ThunderOne platform design tokens, shared by every Workspace. Source: Figma '[DS] - Design System' (kW5RDAy0BZ4Muj9RU3dPgC), page Foundations: 'Design System Thunder One — v2 (Lovable)' built 2026-11-13 from the Lovable code (src/styles.css, Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui new-york), 'Grid / Breakpoints' official standard approved 2026-11-22, Thai type (Anuphan) decided 2026-11-22. Color names are the shadcn variable names used in Figma and code. Hex values are the sRGB approximation of the oklch values in code. Workspace-specific mappings (domain status, icons, vocabulary) live in references/workspaces/<workspace>.md, never here. See references/open-decisions.md before changing any value.",
  "color": {
    "$note": "Light theme only. Figma also has dark values, marked 'untuned shadcn default, NOT approved, not published' (OD-07), so they are not shipped.",
